 <li><strong>Ceny FOB Shenzhen 2026 (MOQ 500)</strong>: GaN 30W — $3,50-5,00, GaN 65W multiport — $6,00-8,50, GaN 100W — $9,00-13,00, GaN 140W PD 3.1 — $18,00-24,00</li>
